{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "NIGHT OF THE CONSUMERS",
    "steam_appid": 1815150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/0d2f1701d91b2f41622d7546b8683e21.avif?t=1753465825\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENTER THE WORLD OF RETAIL HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your new job as a retail store employee  balancing stacking items on empty shelves, mopping up puke, maintaining the standards of the store, handling the constant requests of the rapid consumers and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A fast paced first-person anxiety-inducing thrill ride that invokes horror from the mundane of everyday life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I DON'T GET PAID ENOUGH FOR THIS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the clock ticking down you'll have to resort to more extreme measures to ensure you finish your daily tasks and not upset The Manager. Hurl boxes at the consumers to temporarily stop them and run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively utilize the staff-only rooms which will act as temporary sanctuaries from the dreaded shop floor... but you can't stay there forever... </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced heart-pumping gameplay!  </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Nights </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extra Unlockables/Secrets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PSX-style graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/cebd4b2fb3a32430e9343875b1247fdc.poster.avif?t=1753465825\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/cebd4b2fb3a32430e9343875b1247fdc.webm?t=1753465825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/cebd4b2fb3a32430e9343875b1247fdc.mp4?t=1753465825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/0d2f1701d91b2f41622d7546b8683e21.avif?t=1753465825\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENTER THE WORLD OF RETAIL HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your new job as a retail store employee  balancing stacking items on empty shelves, mopping up puke, maintaining the standards of the store, handling the constant requests of the rapid consumers and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A fast paced first-person anxiety-inducing thrill ride that invokes horror from the mundane of everyday life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I DON'T GET PAID ENOUGH FOR THIS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the clock ticking down you'll have to resort to more extreme measures to ensure you finish your daily tasks and not upset The Manager. Hurl boxes at the consumers to temporarily stop them and run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively utilize the staff-only rooms which will act as temporary sanctuaries from the dreaded shop floor... but you can't stay there forever... </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced heart-pumping gameplay!  </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Nights </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extra Unlockables/Secrets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PSX-style graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/cebd4b2fb3a32430e9343875b1247fdc.poster.avif?t=1753465825\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/cebd4b2fb3a32430e9343875b1247fdc.webm?t=1753465825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815150/extras/cebd4b2fb3a32430e9343875b1247fdc.mp4?t=1753465825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Start your new job in a store overrun by maniacal consumers and their unrelenting thirst for customer service. RETAIL IS HELL!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI can't recommend Night of the Consumer enough. It's bizarre, unsettling, and hilarious all at the same time.\u201d<br />\r\nPC Gamer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cThis game is a capable example of what makes the indie market such a worthwhile place in video games.\u201d<br />\r\nDestructoid<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cNight of the Consumers is far from subtle, but that\u2019s what makes this work so great. It is garish and grotesque and for those who have worked in service, extremely relatable.\u201d<br />\r\nDreadXP<br />\r\n",
